    "notes": [
      "Draft configuration: Operator September 2018 event course plan identifies the earlier infield horseshoe and both frontstretch and backstretch chicanes. Exact nodes from the consistent 2020 independent snapshot retain those earlier branches; the later expanded backstretch and 2024 infield extension are excluded. The source frontstretch and backstretch ways are separately named and retain their pinned versions. This is a draft earlier course centreline, with coarse corner alignment and catalogue distance retained separately; travel direction and historical timing correspondence remain provisional. Branch identity was checked against catalogue layout facts and circuit identification references. Independent source distance 3600.7 m; no coordinates are changed to match a diagram or distance. Travel direction and historical alignment remain provisional."
